\newlabel{tab:main}{{3}{14}{Episode total cost for deployment comparators under the physically coupled generator. All learned policies were trained only at nominal $c=1$; static and reduced-coupling rows are transfers without retraining. MPC-4 is exact only for its stated four-step perfect-forecast objective. Lower is better; bold marks the lowest mean.\relax }{table.caption.9}{}}
